1
00:00:00,149 --> 00:00:07,835
Part 23 mein users aur security: team ki list, naya user invite karna, roles jaise manager,

2
00:00:07,835 --> 00:00:15,522
accountant, billing, warehouse, salesman aur delivery, permission matrix, two-step sign-in,

3
00:00:15,522 --> 00:00:16,873
aur audit trail.

4
00:00:17,841 --> 00:00:20,902
System mein Users and roles kholiye.

5
00:00:20,902 --> 00:00:28,384
Owner, manager aur accountant email, password aur authenticator app se login karte hain.

6
00:00:28,384 --> 00:00:34,421
Warehouse, billing, salesman aur delivery staff employee ID aur PIN se.

7
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:42,775
Team list mein har user ka naam, sign-in ka tareeka, employee ID, two-step on hai ya nahi,

8
00:00:42,775 --> 00:00:44,651
role aur aakhri login.

9
00:00:44,651 --> 00:00:50,023
Hamare demo mein owner ke alawa Ravi salesman, Rahul warehouse,

10
00:00:50,023 --> 00:00:53,264
Manoj delivery aur Pooja billing hain.

11
00:00:53,933 --> 00:00:57,933
Naya user jodte hain: office ka accountant.

12
00:00:57,933 --> 00:01:02,212
Full name, email, role Accountant, aur godown.

13
00:01:02,212 --> 00:01:10,026
Accountant ko password aur authenticator chahiye, isliye invite email par jaata hai.

14
00:01:10,026 --> 00:01:12,073
Create invite dabaiye.

15
00:01:12,775 --> 00:01:16,817
Invite code ban gaya, jo 48 ghante tak valid hai.

16
00:01:16,817 --> 00:01:23,004
Employee sign-in page par I have an invite code se apna account banata hai.

17
00:01:23,004 --> 00:01:30,675
Code video mein dikhaya ja sakta hai kyunki yeh demo hai, asli code kisi se share mat kariye.

18
00:01:31,392 --> 00:01:33,331
Ab permission matrix.

19
00:01:33,331 --> 00:01:41,735
Har row ek permission hai: masters, orders book karna, approve karna, credit hold override,

20
00:01:41,735 --> 00:01:49,769
invoice, invoice cancel, pick and pack, dispatch, delivery, purchase, stock adjustment,

21
00:01:49,769 --> 00:01:54,017
payments, reports, insights, portal aur users.

22
00:01:54,017 --> 00:01:55,772
Har column ek role.

23
00:01:56,475 --> 00:02:02,511
Jaise Salesman ke paas sirf orders book karna aur payment collect karna hai.

24
00:02:02,511 --> 00:02:07,117
Woh approve nahi kar sakta, invoice cancel nahi kar sakta.

25
00:02:07,117 --> 00:02:11,802
Kisi cell par click karke permission de ya hata sakte hain.

26
00:02:11,802 --> 00:02:14,423
Owner ki permissions locked hain.

27
00:02:15,090 --> 00:02:22,665
Jaise warehouse role ko stock adjustment ki permission dete hain, aur phir wapas hata dete hain.

28
00:02:22,665 --> 00:02:25,742
Har badlaav audit trail mein jaata hai.

29
00:02:26,402 --> 00:02:28,588
Ab dekhiye role ka asar.

30
00:02:28,588 --> 00:02:33,323
Yeh Ravi salesman ka phone hai, jo PIN se login hai.

31
00:02:33,323 --> 00:02:41,519
Dhyan dijiye: salesman ko bhi dashboard par poori bikri, vasooli aur bakaya dikh raha hai.

32
00:02:41,519 --> 00:02:45,070
Yeh hamari QA report ka ek finding hai.

33
00:02:51,127 --> 00:02:55,332
Ravi users ka page kholne ki koshish karta hai.

34
00:02:55,332 --> 00:02:59,715
Use permission nahi hai, isliye page nahi khulta.

35
00:03:00,368 --> 00:03:04,531
Two-step sign-in owner aur manager ke liye zaroori hai.

36
00:03:04,531 --> 00:03:08,844
Login par password ke baad authenticator ka 6-digit code.

37
00:03:08,844 --> 00:03:13,461
Bharose wale computer ko 30 din ke liye trust kar sakte hain,

38
00:03:13,461 --> 00:03:17,548
aur phone kho jaaye toh recovery codes kaam aate hain.

39
00:03:18,206 --> 00:03:22,318
Neeche Audit trail hai: kisne, kab, kya kiya.

40
00:03:22,318 --> 00:03:29,903
Order approve, credit override, invoice cancel, stock adjustment, permission badli,

41
00:03:29,903 --> 00:03:34,106
supplier payment, sab naam aur samay ke saath.

42
00:03:34,106 --> 00:03:38,218
Audit entries badli ya mitaayi nahi ja sakti.

43
00:03:38,872 --> 00:03:43,713
Sahi role aur permission se har karmchari sirf apna kaam karta hai,

44
00:03:43,713 --> 00:03:50,216
galti ya gadbad ka khatra kam hota hai, aur zaroorat padne par audit trail se poori kahani

45
00:03:50,216 --> 00:03:51,228
mil jaati hai.

46
00:03:52,853 --> 00:03:59,460
Part 24 mein backup aur security: encrypted backup, Google Drive connection,

47
00:03:59,460 --> 00:04:07,023
backup history, test restore, recovery kit, data export, two-step sign-in, audit trail,

48
00:04:07,023 --> 00:04:09,457
aur data ka maalik kaun hai.

49
00:04:10,404 --> 00:04:13,573
System mein Backup and restore kholiye.

50
00:04:13,573 --> 00:04:19,668
Yeh screen is project ki QA ke dauraan Distribution ke menu mein jodi gayi.

51
00:04:19,668 --> 00:04:24,381
Pehle distributor ko backup ki koi screen nahi dikhti thi,

52
00:04:24,381 --> 00:04:27,632
jabki backup system sabke liye same hai.

53
00:04:28,291 --> 00:04:37,009
Backup AES-256-GCM se encrypted hota hai, aur use sirf aapki recovery kit ki key khol sakti hai.

54
00:04:37,009 --> 00:04:41,277
Recovery kit sign-up ke samay download hui thi.

55
00:04:41,277 --> 00:04:45,999
Yahan key ka fingerprint dikhta hai, poori key nahi.

56
00:04:46,666 --> 00:04:53,403
Google Drive connection: Medoro ke hosted server par backup aapke apne Google Drive mein

57
00:04:53,403 --> 00:04:54,168
jaata hai.

58
00:04:54,168 --> 00:04:58,991
Is demo server par asli Google ki jagah ek test Drive judi hai.

59
00:04:58,991 --> 00:05:04,350
Asli Google account se judne ke liye Connect Google Drive dabate hain.

60
00:05:05,017 --> 00:05:06,715
Backup now dabaiye.

61
00:05:06,715 --> 00:05:10,736
Poore business ka encrypted backup banta hai,

62
00:05:10,736 --> 00:05:19,047
jisme distribution ke saare tables shamil hain: products, batches, orders, invoices, ledgers.

63
00:05:19,047 --> 00:05:24,141
History mein samay, size, checksum aur status dikhta hai.

64
00:05:24,832 --> 00:05:30,802
Test restore backup ko ek alag test copy mein kholta hai aur jaanchta hai,

65
00:05:30,802 --> 00:05:32,739
live data ko chhue bina.

66
00:05:32,739 --> 00:05:39,516
Asli restore owner hi kar sakta hai, business code type karke, taaki galti se na ho.

67
00:05:40,267 --> 00:05:45,717
Data export ke liye har MIS report CSV mein, GST returns JSON mein,

68
00:05:45,717 --> 00:05:50,517
aur chemist aur supplier statements nikaale jaa sakte hain.

69
00:05:50,517 --> 00:05:56,943
Data aapka hai: plan band karne par bhi exports aur backups uplabdh rehte hain.

70
00:05:57,636 --> 00:06:04,617
Security ki baaki parten: owner aur manager ke liye two-step sign-in, staff ke liye PIN,

71
00:06:04,617 --> 00:06:10,249
har role ki seemit permissions, aur badla na ja sakne wala audit trail.

72
00:06:10,249 --> 00:06:14,216
Session ek samay ke baad apne-aap khatam hota hai.

73
00:06:14,904 --> 00:06:19,060
Hosting ke vikalp: Medoro ke cloud par shuru kariye,

74
00:06:19,060 --> 00:06:22,657
ya apne server ya apne database par chalaiye.

75
00:06:22,657 --> 00:06:28,412
Settings mein yeh line saaf likhi hai ki aapke records kahan rehte hain.

76
00:06:29,077 --> 00:06:33,690
Yaad rakhiye: recovery kit kabhi online share mat kariye,

77
00:06:33,690 --> 00:06:36,927
use print karke surakshit jagah rakhiye.

78
00:06:36,927 --> 00:06:42,512
Password, recovery codes aur authenticator kabhi kisi ko mat bataiye,

79
00:06:42,512 --> 00:06:44,697
Medoro support ko bhi nahi.

80
00:06:46,258 --> 00:06:53,315
Part 25 teen hisson mein: pehle subscription aur plans, phir English se Hindi interface,

81
00:06:53,315 --> 00:07:01,014
aur aakhir mein ek poora business din, purchase se lekar delivery aur collection tak, bina ruke.

82
00:07:01,968 --> 00:07:04,430
Pehla hissa: subscription.

83
00:07:04,430 --> 00:07:07,554
System mein Subscription kholiye.

84
00:07:07,554 --> 00:07:14,655
Hamara account Free trial par hai, Professional plan ke saath, 7 din baaki.

85
00:07:14,655 --> 00:07:17,780
Trial mein har feature khula hai.

86
00:07:18,483 --> 00:07:23,602
What your plan includes mein chemist portal, salesman field app,

87
00:07:23,602 --> 00:07:30,160
mobile picking aur dispatch, business intelligence, aur kai godowns aur transfers.

88
00:07:30,160 --> 00:07:35,039
Saath mein godowns, users aur chemists ki ginti ki seema bhi.

89
00:07:35,721 --> 00:07:39,560
Plan aur keemat website par hain.

90
00:07:39,560 --> 00:07:46,890
Standard 2,499 rupaye mahina: ek godown, 8 users, 300 chemists.

91
00:07:46,890 --> 00:07:55,383
Professional 4,999 rupaye: teen godown, 25 users, 2,000 chemists, portal,

92
00:07:55,383 --> 00:07:59,571
field app aur business intelligence.

93
00:07:59,571 --> 00:08:07,133
Enterprise 9,999 rupaye: bees godown, 150 users, 20,000 chemists.

94
00:08:07,850 --> 00:08:10,510
Trial 7 din ka hai, bina card ke.

95
00:08:10,510 --> 00:08:17,765
Plans apne-aap renew nahi hote, kabhi bhi cancel kar sakte hain, aur data wahin rehta hai.

96
00:08:17,765 --> 00:08:22,118
Website par likha hai ki in keemat par GST nahi lagta.

97
00:08:22,118 --> 00:08:25,342
Is demo mein koi payment nahi kiya gaya.

98
00:08:26,031 --> 00:08:27,983
Doosra hissa: bhasha.

99
00:08:27,983 --> 00:08:30,956
Upar EN aur Hindi ka toggle hai.

100
00:08:30,956 --> 00:08:39,227
Hindi dabaate hi poora interface Hindi mein badal jaata hai: menu, buttons, aur headings.

101
00:08:39,930 --> 00:08:47,213
Dashboard par dekhiye: aaj ki bikri, mahine ki bikri, vasooli aur bakaya, sab Hindi mein.

102
00:08:47,213 --> 00:08:53,023
Orders, invoice aur credit jaise vyaapaar ke shabd bhi Hindi mein hain,

103
00:08:53,023 --> 00:08:57,278
par product ke naam aur numbers waise hi rehte hain.

104
00:08:57,952 --> 00:09:01,241
Har user apni bhasha khud chun sakta hai.

105
00:09:01,241 --> 00:09:07,981
Owner Hindi mein kaam kare aur accountant English mein, dono ke liye data ek hi hai.

106
00:09:07,981 --> 00:09:10,548
Wapas English mein badalte hain.

107
00:09:11,220 --> 00:09:14,399
Teesra hissa: ek poora business din.

108
00:09:14,399 --> 00:09:21,374
Subah owner login karke dashboard dekhta hai: bikri, bakaya aur order pipeline.

109
00:09:21,374 --> 00:09:29,144
Phir credit control mein top outstanding chemists, aur expiry desk par near-expiry maal.

110
00:09:29,818 --> 00:09:37,880
Eastern Demo Super Stockist se Telmiva aur Glucocheck ka maal aaya, jiska PO pehle bheja tha.

111
00:09:37,880 --> 00:09:45,941
Receive goods mein PO chuniye, batch aur expiry bhariye, printed total daaliye, aur Post GRN.

112
00:09:45,941 --> 00:09:49,062
Stock aur supplier ka hisaab update.

113
00:09:50,332 --> 00:09:58,242
Dopahar se pehle salesman Ravi City Care Chemists par order leta hai: Febrinil 650 ke 20

114
00:09:58,242 --> 00:10:00,400
packs aur Telmiva ke 10.

115
00:10:00,400 --> 00:10:03,456
Order seedha office pahunchta hai.

116
00:10:08,481 --> 00:10:11,180
Office mein order khulta hai.

117
00:10:11,180 --> 00:10:14,997
Credit check: City Care within limit hai.

118
00:10:14,997 --> 00:10:20,116
Febrinil par 10 plus 2 scheme se 4 packs free apne-aap.

119
00:10:20,116 --> 00:10:24,677
Approve dabaya, aur FEFO batches reserve ho gaye.

120
00:10:25,494 --> 00:10:29,668
Godown mein Rahul ke phone par pick list aa gayi.

121
00:10:29,668 --> 00:10:34,778
Rack aur batch dekh kar har line pick, phir 1 box mein pack.

122
00:10:38,961 --> 00:10:46,589
Office mein packed order se wholesale GST invoice: same state, toh CGST aur SGST.

123
00:10:46,589 --> 00:10:50,261
Invoice par free goods bhi chhape hain.

124
00:10:50,921 --> 00:10:58,300
Dispatch par City Care ka invoice chuna, Manoj ko delivery person banaya, trip plan kiya,

125
00:10:58,300 --> 00:10:59,461
aur van nikli.

126
00:11:04,963 --> 00:11:08,624
Shaam ko Manoj ne City Care par maal diya.

127
00:11:08,624 --> 00:11:14,027
Receiver ka naam likha aur chemist ne UPI se poore paise diye.

128
00:11:14,027 --> 00:11:17,775
Payment turant chemist ke khaate mein jama.

129
00:11:19,025 --> 00:11:25,752
Din ke ant mein owner dashboard dekhta hai: aaj ki bikri aur vasooli badh gayi.

130
00:11:25,752 --> 00:11:32,053
Collections report mein UPI receipt, aur City Care ka outstanding kam hua.

131
00:11:32,727 --> 00:11:38,766
Aakhir mein expiry risk aur credit ageing par ek nazar, taaki kal ka kaam tay ho.

132
00:11:38,766 --> 00:11:44,507
Yahi hai Medoro Distribution ka poora order to cash cycle, ek hi system mein.
